 "notes": "Backed by the OIDF conformance suite result: plan oid4vci-1_0-wallet-test-plan, suite 5.3.4, module oid4vci-1_0-wallet-test-credential-issuance PASSED on 2026-11-04 \u2014 the suite's credential endpoint demanded the resource server's own nonce (WWW-Authenticate: DPoP error=use_dpop_nonce) and accepted the retried proof. The retried request is the assertable behaviour; the fresh nonce itself rides inside the retried DPoP proof JWT, which the transcript matcher does not decode."
